00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:25.930
<v Adam Davidson>Then supplemental letter-- supplementary letter. Will things be the same once the sexual tension is gone? I think that's half the fun. It's what has kept Moonlighting on the air. Will we still be able to joke about getting married, et cetera, without feeling uncomfortable? Confusion, is there an S in confusion? I'm even mixed up about that.
<v Adam Davidson>然后是补充信——补充信。一旦性张力消失，一切还会一样吗？我想那才是乐趣的一半。正是这一点让《蓝色月光》一直播下去。我们还能开玩笑说结婚之类的事吗？而不会感到尴尬？困惑，困惑里有S吗？连这个问题都让我很困惑。

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:39.770
<v Adam Davidson>We went out after that for a year. [APPLAUSE]
