00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:17.340
<v Andrew Fenchel>Time, 10:00 PM. June 10, '96. Dear Carla, what's up, babe? How are you doing? Fine, I hope. Well, I'm in Vienna. But I didn't forget to write.
<v Andrew Fenchel>时间，晚上10点。1996年6月10日。亲爱的卡拉，怎么了，宝贝？你还好吗？希望你很好。嗯，我在维也纳。但我没忘记给你写信。

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:40.180
<v Andrew Fenchel>Baby, I miss you. I can't wait to see you. I've been thinking about you all the time, and I can't stop. I got into a fight in here with a king, and for that I got two weeks in the hole. Baby, I hope you're not talking to someone else. I've been waiting for your letters, but I haven't received any yet. What's up with that?
<v Andrew Fenchel>宝贝，我想你。我等不及要见你了。我一直想着你，停不下来。我和一个国王打了一架，因此我被关了两周禁闭。宝贝，希望你没有和别人说话。我一直在等你的信，但还没收到。怎么回事？

00:13:40.180 --> 00:14:02.440
<v Andrew Fenchel>Carla, I feel that you don't love me anymore. Baby, I love you more than what you could ever know. I miss making love to you, kissing you. Please send me some pictures of you. When I get out of here, I'm going to get a job. I'll even quit gang-banging if you show me you love me.
<v Andrew Fenchel>卡拉，我觉得你不再爱我了。宝贝，我爱你胜过你能想象的任何程度。我想念和你做爱，亲吻你。请寄给我一些你的照片。我出去后，会找份工作。如果你表现出爱我，我甚至会退出帮派。

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:20.570
<v Andrew Fenchel>Carla, what do you mean when you say you went from 100% to 50%? I don't understand. I haven't been cheating on you, and I'll be with you all the time when I get out. Carla, I care about you a lot. You just don't know.
<v Andrew Fenchel>卡拉，你说从100%变成50%是什么意思？我不明白。我没有背叛你，我出去后会一直陪着你。卡拉，我非常在乎你。你只是不知道。

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:38.480
<v Andrew Fenchel>Why is your mom going to kick you out? What have you done? Please don't lie to me. Are you [BLEEP] around with someone else, staying out late? What is it? I've got the feeling you are seeing someone else, but I guess I can't trip, so long as when I get out, you come back to me.
<v Andrew Fenchel>你妈妈为什么要把你赶出去？你做了什么？请别对我说谎。你是不是在和别人（消音），还在外面待到很晚？怎么了？我有种感觉你在和别人约会，但我猜我不能抱怨，只要我出去时你回到我身边就行。

00:14:38.480 --> 00:15:04.990
<v Andrew Fenchel>What do you mean that you love me and good luck in life? [LAUGHTER] I get the first part but not the second. [LAUGHTER] [APPLAUSE] Are you breaking up with me? Are you going away from me? Whatever you do, wherever you go, you'll always be in my heart, Carla. Believe that.
<v Andrew Fenchel>你说你爱我，祝我生活顺利是什么意思？（笑声）前半部分我懂，后半部分我不懂。（笑声）（掌声）你要和我分手吗？你要离开我吗？无论你做什么，无论你去哪，你永远在我心中，卡拉。相信这一点。

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:18.050
<v Andrew Fenchel>I know you think I don't love you anymore, but you're wrong, babe. I said it before and I'll say it again, I love you Carla. [APPLAUSE]
