00:23:16.050 --> 00:23:25.550
<v Ira Glass>Now I'm sure you can only look back on the incredible naivety. Some young man is prowling the streets of Seattle, walking through the U District, telling women--
<v Ira Glass>现在我确信你只能回顾当时难以置信的幼稚。某个年轻人正在西雅图街头徘徊，穿过大学区，告诉女人们——

