00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:57.020
<v David Hauptschein>We're going to begin with Joe Fosco. In preparation for this show, we spent many hours surfing the net together and finding files that we thought were interesting. And Joe's going to come up and read some. [APPLAUSE]
<v David Hauptschein>我们将从乔·福斯科开始。为了准备这个节目，我们花了很多时间一起浏览网页，寻找我们认为有趣的档案。乔会上来朗读一些。（掌声）

00:23:57.020 --> 00:24:02.280
<v David Hauptschein>Wait a minute, Joe. Let me get this timer going here. I've got to put these other ones in different places.
